{"total_count":341572,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38/events","html_url":"https://github.com/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38","id":5435875559,"node_id":"I_kwDOUYHbVM8AAAABRADg5w","number":38,"title":"Detect breaking OpenAPI contract changes","user":{"login":"d-ducluzeaud","id":322582907,"node_id":"U_kgDOEzo5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322582907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud","html_url":"https://github.com/d-ducluzeaud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12169133577,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUYHbVM8AAAAC1VY-CQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/labels/type:story","name":"type:story","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Vertical user-facing backend slice","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12169133604,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUYHbVM8AAAAC1VY-JA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/labels/area:foundation","name":"area:foundation","color":"C5DEF5","default":false,"description":"Platform and delivery foundation","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/milestones/1","html_url":"https://github.com/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/milestone/1","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/milestones/1/labels","id":17821903,"node_id":"MI_kwDOUYHbVM4BD_DP","number":1,"title":"Foundation","description":"Reproducible API platform and delivery baseline","creator":{"login":"d-ducluzeaud","id":322582907,"node_id":"U_kgDOEzo5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322582907?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud","html_url":"https://github.com/d-ducluzeaud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-ducluzeaud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":4,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-09-12T20:36:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T20:39:13Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-12T20:39:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T20:39:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/2","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## User outcome\\n\\nReviewers can distinguish intentional API evolution from accidental contract drift.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nCompare the generated contract with the accepted baseline; fail CI on unexplained drift; report breaking changes clearly; document the intentional-change workflow.\\n\\n## Out of scope\\n\\nPublishing a public client SDK or supporting multiple API versions.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] The stated behavior is observable through the public API contract where applicable.\\n- [ ] Runtime validation and RFC 9457 errors cover invalid input and failure paths.\\n- [ ] Relevant automated tests and PostgreSQL constraints pass.\\n- [ ] OpenAPI, Bruno, and operational documentation are updated when affected.\\n- [ ] CI is green.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d-ducluzeaud/pace-craft/issues/38/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648/events","html_url":"https://github.com/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648","id":5592602677,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfwe488AAAABTVhYNQ","number":648,"title":"OpenAPI snapshot and breaking-change check in CI","user":{"login":"blockchain-maxis","id":267648998,"node_id":"U_kgDOD_P_5g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267648998?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis","html_url":"https://github.com/blockchain-maxis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockchain-maxis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11240948462,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfwe488AAAACngNC7g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/labels/javascript","name":"javascript","color":"168700","default":false,"description":"Pull requests that update javascript code","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11645041103,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfwe488AAAACthk5zw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/labels/area:%20infra","name":"area: infra","color":"bfd4f2","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12357011327,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfwe488AAAAC4IkHfw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/labels/area:%20api","name":"area: api","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Public REST API /api/v1 and its OpenAPI document","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-26T08:33:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T10:01:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Depends on:** #626, #628\n\nThe versioning policy in #624 only holds if CI enforces it. A committed snapshot of the OpenAPI document makes every API change show up in the diff. A small rule checker catches the changes that #624 says require a v2.\n\n**Scope**\n- `apps/web/scripts/export-openapi.mts` writes `docs/api/openapi-v1.json` (sorted keys, stable formatting). Add the scripts `pnpm --filter @signet/web openapi:export` and `openapi:check`. The check fails when the committed file is stale.\n- `scripts/check-openapi-breaking.mjs` compares the PR's document with `main`'s snapshot. It fails on:\n  - a removed path or operation;\n  - a removed response property;\n  - a changed property type;\n  - a new required request parameter;\n  - a newly required response field being dropped;\n  - a removed enum value.\n\n  The PR label `api: breaking` does **not** bypass it. A breaking change needs `/api/v2`.\n- Add both checks to the `docs` job in `ci.yml`.\n\n**Acceptance**\n- Fixture tests for `check-openapi-breaking.mjs` (`scripts/check-openapi-breaking.test.mjs`): adding an optional field passes; removing a field fails; changing `string` to `number` fails; adding an endpoint passes.\n- A stale snapshot fails `openapi:check` with the exact command to fix it.\n\n---\n<sub>Backlog ID `H-15`</sub>\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blockchain-maxis/signet/issues/648/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282/events","html_url":"https://github.com/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282","id":5122472095,"node_id":"I_kwDOGrU1l88AAAABMVK4nw","number":282,"title":"Add OpenAPI Breaking Change Checker","user":{"login":"MartinGryner","id":934713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzNDcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/934713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner","html_url":"https://github.com/MartinGryner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MartinGryner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-11T16:43:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T17:55:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"> **This tool is not hosted in a public GitHub repository.**\n\n## Tool Properties\n\n- Display name: OpenAPI Breaking Change Checker\n- Description: Free browser tool that compares Swagger 2.0 and OpenAPI 3.0/3.1 JSON or YAML descriptions locally and reports likely client-breaking, review-needed, and compatible changes. Internal JSON Pointer references are resolved; external references are reported but not fetched.\n- Repository: Not open source; no public repository.\n- Homepage: https://martingruner.com/tools/openapi-breaking-change-checker\n\n## OpenAPI Versions\n\n- 3.1: true\n- 3.0: true\n- 2.0: true","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OAI/tools.openapis.org/issues/282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693","id":5598061459,"node_id":"I_kwDOR5tQxc8AAAABTaujkw","number":693,"title":"DIST-05: OpenAPI version tagging and breaking-change checks","user":{"login":"yeongseon","id":8798819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTg4MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8798819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon","html_url":"https://github.com/yeongseon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeongseon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12391656084,"node_id":"LA_kwDOR5tQxc8AAAAC4pmqlA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/labels/type:chore","name":"type:chore","color":"cfd3d7","default":false,"description":"Maintenance, no behaviour change (POLICY 2.1)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12391656135,"node_id":"LA_kwDOR5tQxc8AAAAC4pmqxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/labels/review:R2","name":"review:R2","color":"f9a825","default":false,"description":"Public API, builder API, OpenAPI, spec, transformation (POLICY 18.1)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-26T23:01:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T00:22:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Problem\n\nThe protection against breaking the OpenAPI contract is partial.\n\n# Evidence\n\nThe drift tests **exist and work** — adding `/admin/*` in #680 made CI fail three times over missing entries in `_IMPLEMENTED_OPERATIONS` and `_OPERATION_STATUS_CODES`.\n\nWhat is missing is **version tagging and a breaking-change judgement**. The current tests only ask whether the declaration and the implementation agree, so a change that deliberately breaks the contract passes as long as both sides are edited together.\n\n# Scope\n\n- [ ] Version tagging for the builder OpenAPI contract\n- [ ] A breaking-change check (removed fields, changed types, removed status codes)\n- [ ] Generated types in studio plus a drift check in CI\n\n# Non-goals\n\n- Supporting multiple contract versions simultaneously\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A PR that breaks the contract fails CI\n- [ ] An intentional break can pass with an explicit approval\n\n# Required Verification\n\nV2\n\n# Product Epic\n\nEPIC-D — Distribution\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeongseon/kpubdata-builder/issues/693/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899/events","html_url":"https://github.com/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/pull/899","id":5522581638,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTE8Yrs8AAAABEXQFJQ","number":899,"title":"chore: Add OpenAPI breaking-change detection to CI (20260920T150053Z-add-openapi-breaking-change-detection-to-b570)","user":{"login":"robotsix-mill[bot]","id":285582353,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOEQWkEQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130368771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/robotsix-mill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robotsix-mill%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-21T04:02:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T04:02:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/pulls/899","html_url":"https://github.com/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/pull/899","diff_url":"https://github.com/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/pull/899.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/pull/899.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Problem\n\nThe repository has strong OpenAPI schema validation in CI (drift checking and Redocly linting at `.github/workflows/ci.yml` lines 524–554), but **no breaking-change detection**. The current `openapi-drift` job ensures the schema matches the code and is syntactically valid, but does not flag when endpoints are removed, response fields are required, parameter types change, or HTTP status codes shift — all of which could break API consumers.\n\n## Current State\n\n- `openapi-drift` CI job regenerates `docs/lifecycle/openapi.json` and checks for staleness with `git diff --exit-code`\n- Redocly linting validates schema syntax compliance\n- Route stability test (`tests/lifecycle/routers/test_self_config.py:323`) manually checks specific critical routes\n- **Missing**: Automated detection of backward-incompatible schema changes\n\n## Solution\n\nIntegrate a breaking-change detector into the CI pipeline:\n\n1. Add `openapi-diff` (or similar tool) as a dev dependency:\n   ```\n   npm install --save-dev @openapitools/openapi-diff\n   # or: uv run --with openapi-diff\n   ```\n\n2. Extend `.github/workflows/ci.yml` `openapi-drift` job (after Redocly lint):\n   ```bash\n   - name: Check for OpenAPI breaking changes\n     run: |\n       if [ -f docs/lifecycle/openapi.json.baseline ]; then\n         openapi-diff docs/lifecycle/openapi.json.baseline docs/lifecycle/openapi.json --fail-on-breaking-changes\n       fi\n   ```\n\n3. On intentional breaking changes, document the change in CHANGELOG.md and require manual approval (e.g., commit signing or approval gate).\n\n## Why This Matters\n\n- **API stability**: Prevents accidental breaking changes from silently reaching consumers\n- **Observability**: CI output clearly lists what changed (removed endpoints, schema changes, etc.)\n- **Standard practice**: Tools like GitHub's OpenAPI, AWS SDK, and major API providers enforce breaking-change detection\n- **Low friction**: Single CI step, no code changes required\n\n## References\n\n- Current schema: `docs/lifecycle/openapi.json` (version \"0.1.0\")\n- Current drift check: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` lines 524–554\n- Tools: `openapi-diff`, `spectacle`, or equivalent\n\n\n<!-- survey-gap-id: openapi_breaking_change_detection -->\n\n---\nAutomated by robotsix-mill · ticket `20260920T150053Z-add-openapi-breaking-change-detection-to-b570`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/damien-robotsix/robotsix-central-deploy/issues/899/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}